<title>USA: CNA Financial unit opens office in Singapore.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial unit opens office in Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp said Tuesday its CNA Re division has opened an office in Singapore.</p>
<p>CNA Re said the office is a major step in opening up the potential of Far East markets. The company said the office will underwrite traditional insurance lines including property, casualty and creditor.</p>
<p>CNA Re also has offices in six U.S. cities as well as Amsterdam, Bermuda, Milan and Zurich.</p>
<p>CNA Financial is an insurance holding company.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged Tuesday afternoon at 106.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
